  "aiEnrichment": {
    "tmdb_id": 1419406,
    "hash": "e3cb71d1f7d0ad3d0a22a89adaeaf4edf974b65118045da3573b5672413663bd",
    "summary_one_sentence": "Macau Police pull a legendary tracking expert out of retirement to assemble a specialized surveillance unit and hunt down an elusive crew of master thieves.",
    "summary_short": "After a daring heist leaves Macau authorities completely outmatched by a highly organized syndicate, the police coax retired tracking specialist Wong Tak-Chung back into action. Tasked with mentoring a fresh team of young officers, Wong teaches them traditional physical surveillance to counter the criminals' high-tech methods. Together, the newly formed unit embarks on an intense cat-and-mouse game through the neon-lit streets of Macau to capture the syndicate's brilliant mastermind.",
    "summary_long": "When an elusive group of professional thieves pulls off a high-stakes robbery in Macau, local authorities find themselves completely outmaneuvered by the syndicate's meticulous planning and technical wizardry. Realizing that modern digital surveillance is not enough, the Macau Police reach out to Wong Tak-Chung, a legendary retired tracking expert known for his unmatched human observation skills. Though initially reluctant to return, Wong agrees to rejoin the force on the condition that he can handpick and train a specialized surveillance squad. He takes under his wing a group of eager rookie officers, instilling in them the lost art of physical tailing, instinct, and psychological analysis. As the team painstakingly pieces together the subtle breadcrumbs left behind by the criminals, they realize they are pursuing a deadly crew led by a ruthless mastermind who always stays one step ahead. Tensions rise within the unit as long-buried rivalries and personal stakes surface during the high-pressure investigation. Wong's steady mentorship keeps the young officers grounded through tight escapes and intense street pursuits across Macau's sprawling urban landscape. Sensing the net tightening around them, the thieves launch a series of bold counter-tactics designed to eliminate their pursuers once and for all. Ultimately, through a combination of vintage detective work and strategic teamwork, Wong and his proteges corner the gang in a thrilling final showdown to restore order to the city.",
    "synopsis": "In the vibrant metropolis of Macau, a brilliant crew of professional thieves executes an impossible heist, vanishing into the shadows without leaving a single digital trace. Realizing their advanced electronic grids are useless against such tradecraft, the Macau Police bring retired surveillance veteran Wong Tak-Chung back to active duty. Wong recruits a group of promising young officers, training them in old-school tracking, psychological profiling, and human surveillance techniques. As the squad dives into the city's underbelly, a thrilling game of tactical chess unfolds between Wong's dedicated team and the lethal criminal organization.",
